# Summary Table

| Problem             | Cause                                  | Solution                               |
| ------------------- | -------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |
| Race Condition      | Shared mutable data                    | `synchronized`, Locks, `AtomicInteger` |
| Critical Section    | Shared code                            | Synchronization                        |
| Atomicity           | Non-atomic operations                  | `AtomicInteger`, Synchronization       |
| Visibility          | Stale cached values                    | `volatile`                             |
| Ordering            | Instruction reordering                 | `volatile`, Synchronization            |
| Deadlock            | Circular waiting                       | Lock ordering, `tryLock()`             |
| Starvation          | Thread never gets resources            | Fair scheduling                        |
| Livelock            | Threads keep reacting without progress | Change retry strategy                  |
| Thread Interference | Simultaneous updates                   | Synchronization                        |
| Resource Contention | Too many threads sharing one resource  | Reduce contention                      |
| Thread Leakage      | Threads never terminate                | `ExecutorService`                      |
| Context Switching   | Excessive thread creation              | Thread pools                           |

